STEP 5 — Open Patient

The Patient List now has an Open option.

patients.html contains an Action column.

patient-list.js creates an Open link for each patient.

The link looks like:

patient-details.html?patientId=PAT-000001

The Patient ID is passed through the URL.

New file:

hospital/patient-details.html

New JavaScript:

hospital/js/patient-details.js

patient-details.js reads the Patient ID from the URL using:

window.location.search

and:

URLSearchParams

It then gets the patient array using:

getPatients()

and finds the matching patient.

Basic flow:

All Patients
    ↓
Open
    ↓
Patient Details
    ↓
Read patientId from URL
    ↓
getPatients()
    ↓
Find patient
    ↓
Display details


